"Instructor Warin-doyis is a famous Artonan storyteller who performs all over Anesidora."
"He has small dark eyes, an inky purple braid, much jewelry and clothes in two dark purples."
"He draws shadowy shapes with a wand and picks one or two magical effects per story."
"His storytelling course at Celena North is his only season-long class on Earth."
"The course is one of the hardest to get into; he gladly added Alden and Lute to make twenty."
"His tale of Yott the Useless teaches that a storyteller must only be better than silence."
